<title>JAPAN: Sekisui Hokuriku -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sekisui Hokuriku -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996  (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.55		vs	    6.41</p>
<p> Operating	  749    million	  vs	  668    million</p>
<p> Current	    769    million	  vs	  721    million</p>
<p> Net		  377    million	  vs	  354    million</p>
<p> EPS		   36.39 yen	  vs	   37.56 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sekisui House Hokuriku Ltd is a prefabricated housing contractor.</p>
</text>
